# The shape of %APPDATA%\PlaylistFlow\.env, which File > Settings writes for you.
# Placeholders only. Never commit, share or publish a filled-in copy: every
# key here is personal to the person who registered it.

# REQUIRED. Your own Spotify developer app (developer.spotify.com/dashboard),
# in Development Mode. Sign-in is PKCE, so there is no client secret. Add your
# own Spotify account under the app's User Management, or playlist reads
# return 403.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=

# REQUIRED. Your own free FreqBlog key, the main BPM and key source.
# freqblog.com, 1000 requests a month on the free tier, one free key per person.
FREQBLOG_API_KEY=

# OPTIONAL. Your own GetSongBPM key, a fallback for tracks FreqBlog misses.
# getsongbpm.com/api. Their terms require a visible link back to
# getsongbpm.com; the About dialog carries it.
GETSONGBPM_API_KEY=
